<title>FINLAND: OKOBANK NAMES ELOMAA TO HEAD OPSTOCK.</title>
<headline>OKOBANK NAMES ELOMAA TO HEAD OPSTOCK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish cooperative banking group OKOBANK said on Wednesday it had appointed Juhani Elomaa assistant director in charge of its capital markets department and managing director of its Opstock Oy brokerage from August 1.</p>
<p>Elomaa, 37, was previously managing director of Oy Selin Corporate Finance Ab, and at OKOBANK he succeeds Timo Ritakallio who joins the executive board as of July 1, OKOBANK said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
